  "_comment": "Mantel's looks (Settings › Appearance › Look and Mode). Read by shell/Theme.qml (the shell) and theme/hearth-theme (labwc, Qt, GTK and KDE colours). hearth/dark is the reference: hearth-theme turns Hearth's own colour files into any other look by mapping each colour from these tokens to the chosen ones. corner = the largest corner radius (0 = no cap). Style tokens (the shell only; docs/MANTEL.md): islandStyle floating | bar | shelf, frame plain | chamfer | neon | wood | frost, thin (a 36 px bar), dockAutoHide, deskClock (the desktop clock's default), perfIsland, edgeGlow, scanlines, hints (the controller-hint strip always shown), desc, order. A look only gives defaults: your own accent, wallpaper and Bar and dock choices always win.",
